 After a day of work in Verrocchio's studio, young Leonardo goes home.

38
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:46,320
 Preasting no time to eat, he starts work right away.

39
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:50,240
 For he's bound and determined to learn everything and understand it.

40
