 As for assassinations, well, frankly, there were too many to count.

44
00:06:26,940 --> 00:06:33,840
 He's a man of his word. I don't think he'll make things difficult for us.

45
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:37,920
 He's quite aware that our corporation of drapers cannot function under such unfavorable conditions.

46
