 We think he's too important. Maybe we should just skip the subject. Maybe that's best.

50
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:56,420
 Well, my good friend, I don't agree with you in this matter.

51
00:06:56,620 --> 00:06:58,820
 I ask you to trust me. This fellow knows what he's after.

52
