 Why, yes.

57
00:07:18,940 --> 00:07:21,610
 But I ask for nothing more than to help you.

58
00:07:21,610 --> 00:07:21,870
 Ah.

59
00:07:22,470 --> 00:07:24,780
 I'm here to defend our profession.

60
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,540
 You can believe me, you'll get satisfaction.

61
00:07:26,540 --> 00:07:28,940
 I will personally manage the doctor myself.

62
00:07:30,780 --> 00:07:35,120
 No, believe me, we'll fix all this, and Lorenzo de' Medici will do justice by your demands.

63
