 Oh, now see what I mean?

64
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:43,160
 The city of Volterra refuses delivery of alum. Without alum, nothing could be done.

65
00:07:43,420 --> 00:07:45,380
 Obviously, we'll just have to get it for ourselves.

66
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:49,020
 No sooner said than done.

67
