 One, three. Wrong. Four to four. Pretty bad. I could just watch it fly. The wings glide. This inspiration is nature. Hey, easy, bud, easy. Hey, my bird. Oh, my good lord. Don't quite have it. Bash him to bits. Go on, bash him to bits. Those two beasts be about to bash him. Go on, go on. Go on. Go on. Go on.

