 Master, may we see your project?

165
00:17:19,270 --> 00:17:20,770
 By your means, my friend, come look.

166
00:17:22,770 --> 00:17:24,530
 This fresco will go where?

167
00:17:24,610 --> 00:17:25,350
 On this wall.

168
00:17:25,630 --> 00:17:26,090
 And mine?

169
00:17:26,310 --> 00:17:27,510
 Hey, my project goes where?

170
00:17:28,070 --> 00:17:30,310
 And what will happen to my project?

171
00:17:30,430 --> 00:17:31,070
 Hey, you guys?

172
00:17:31,350 --> 00:17:33,390
 This wall has the best lighting, and I want it too.

173
00:17:33,490 --> 00:17:34,970
