00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:27,020
 Who, me?

219
00:19:27,320 --> 00:19:27,760
 Flying?

220
00:19:27,900 --> 00:19:29,480
 Oh, no, Pop, not me.

221
00:19:29,910 --> 00:19:31,540
 One day you'll regret it, son.

222
00:19:33,970 --> 00:19:36,520
 Now, let's see.

223
00:19:38,540 --> 00:19:40,380
 Hmm, there.

224
00:19:40,670 --> 00:19:41,800
 Oh, my lord.

225
00:19:48,340 --> 00:19:49,700
 Lunderer, you're fired.

226
