 Up you go then, jump, it's easy.

233
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:07,670
 And then...

234
00:20:07,670 --> 00:20:08,390
 You're gonna fly.

235
00:20:10,140 --> 00:20:16,850
 Are you afraid?

236
00:20:17,280 --> 00:20:18,390
 Yeah, I'm never scared.

237
00:20:18,570 --> 00:20:20,250
 I fear you might be too heavy.

238
00:20:22,570 --> 00:20:23,750
 You've had your warning.

239
00:20:25,050 --> 00:20:32,670
 He's flying, he's flying, he's flying.

240
00:20:34,870 --> 00:20:40,210
 Smile, I think I've got it.

241
00:20:40,510 --> 00:20:41,850
 I've got it, my cracky.

242
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:06,240
 One day, in the Arno Valley,

243
00:21:06,970 --> 00:21:09,090
 Maestro's lively curiosities again aroused.

